<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Sept car sales up 29.7 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Sept car sales up 29.7 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger car sales in Malaysia rose 29.7 percent year-on-year in September to 26,694 units, the Malaysian Motor Traders Association (MMTA) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Commercial vehicle sales rose by 50.1 percent to 7,654 units over the corresponding period of last year, MMTA said in a statement.  </p>
<p>				 Sept 1996     Aug 1996     Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Passenger cars	  26,694	  26,134	 20,582</p>
<p>    Commercial vehicles    7,654	   7,447	  5,099</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
